{"items":[{"id":"1503411003845341186","title":"大家不要看今天涨了就很开心，觉得至暗时…","content":"<p>大家不要看今天涨了就很开心，觉得至暗时刻已经过去了。&lt;br&gt;实际现在市场的逻辑就一个:&lt;br&gt;看美联储的脸色。</p>","excerpt":"大家不要看今天涨了就很开心，觉得至暗时…","voteupCount":91,"commentCount":7,"created":1651221115,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1503411003845341186"},{"id":"1503296318798204929","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-08a70d2944fef1d731b08307ad6669a0_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1609\" height=\"3548\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":120,"commentCount":23,"created":1651193772,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1503296318798204929"},{"id":"1502990629617905664","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e8df3536f622aab7899245701f0e07a7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1334\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":188,"commentCount":9,"created":1651120890,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1502990629617905664"},{"id":"1502636763587330050","title":"美国这是搬起石头砸那啥了","content":"<p>美国这是搬起石头砸那啥了。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9319deb53c1612db5c91aaa7d302b04b_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1337\">","excerpt":"美国这是搬起石头砸那啥了","voteupCount":175,"commentCount":48,"created":1651036522,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1502636763587330050"},{"id":"1502302123002245122","title":"我其实不喜欢搞那种赢麻论","content":"<p>我其实不喜欢搞那种赢麻论。&lt;br&gt;除了调侃式的回答外吧，我觉得输赢还是很明显的，赢了就是赢，输就是输，真没那么多有的没的。&lt;br&gt;2020年中国外贸肯定是赢，但你要硬扯2022年也是赢，那我是真不知道咋评价了。</p>","excerpt":"我其实不喜欢搞那种赢麻论","voteupCount":105,"commentCount":9,"created":1650956737,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1502302123002245122"},{"id":"1502262256037044224","title":"说实话 我挺怕看见股市下跌时给到段子的","content":"<p>说实话&lt;br&gt;我挺怕看见股市下跌时给到段子的。&lt;br&gt;因为按照我以往的经验，在市场还有心情写段子的时候，一般还远没有跌到底.........</p>","excerpt":"说实话 我挺怕看见股市下跌时给到段子的","voteupCount":87,"commentCount":17,"created":1650947232,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1502262256037044224"},{"id":"1502216992001683456","title":"现在这新闻越来越离谱了","content":"<p>现在这新闻越来越离谱了。&lt;br&gt;美国暴跌0.5%，A股微调5%，属实是又赢了。</p>","excerpt":"现在这新闻越来越离谱了","voteupCount":123,"commentCount":7,"created":1650936440,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1502216992001683456"},{"id":"1501995272368865280","title":"离岸人民币6.6","content":"<p>离岸人民币6.6</p>","excerpt":"离岸人民币6.6","voteupCount":67,"commentCount":12,"created":1650883578,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1501995272368865280"},{"id":"1501936333292003328","title":"本来按照这个节奏晚上肯定是要分析A股的","content":"<p>本来按照这个节奏晚上肯定是要分析A股的。&lt;br&gt;但公众号今天会发广告，没办法，很早就定下的，所以分析的话会明天发，希望大家理解一下</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-21aee3d7f1eb2a1474974574cf4face8_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1371\">","excerpt":"本来按照这个节奏晚上肯定是要分析A股的","voteupCount":72,"commentCount":7,"created":1650869526,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1501936333292003328"},{"id":"1501895110053277696","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-a198d4f7fe33e3757cf05c69a9ff2947_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1283\" height=\"898\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":135,"commentCount":8,"created":1650859698,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1501895110053277696"}]}